## Phase 5 — Output / deliverables for the engagement

For each app you bypass, record in a notebook (kept in your VFS-style scope dir
if applicable):

- App bundle ID + version
- Pinning library detected (from Phase 1 fingerprint)
- Method used (A/B/C-x/D/E) + exact Frida script
- Endpoints that were pinned vs not
- Any pin set / SPKI hashes recovered (often valuable on its own)
- Whether bypass survives across app updates (binary patch fingerprint shifts;
  Frida hook usually survives)

